user env MSYS=winsymlinks:nativestrict set (Developer Mode is on: AllowDevelopmentWithoutDevLicense=1) so Git Bash's ln -s makes real symlinks; scratch_copy.sh --selftest went 8/12 -> 11/12 with it (3/12 before rsync)
